# Landing page and app are now served natively as index.html at their own
# paths (/ -> index.html, /app -> app/index.html) -- no redirect/rewrite
# rules needed. The previous "200 rewrite" rules here actually issued real
# 307 redirects on Cloudflare Workers static assets (unlike classic Pages,
# where a 200-status _redirects rule means rewrite) -- confirmed live via
# curl, every visit showed /klarmoney-landing or /Klar%20Rebrand in the
# address bar instead of the clean / or /app. Renaming the files to the
# standard index.html convention fixes this with zero redirect rules.
